This is a library for managing communication with gdb using
the MI interface.

This is the Cray Inc. fork of the libmi library.

-- Aug 17, 2026 John Vogt john.leroy.vogt@hpe

The fork for libmi was created on or before Dec 6, 2013, and was modified freely since with
no consideration for upstreaming.  At this point I can find no sign of a publicly available 
version of this package and it is entirely possible that gdb4hpc is the only active user of
this library.    As there is no intention of keeping libmi as a separate package and no
repository to upstream to, I've just pulled the current version of this code directly into
the gdb4hpc repository.  The original license and copyright requirements would still apply.
